window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Trippy clairvoyant frogs predict a dark turn for our hero, Alan. And this time, they may be right.</b><br> <br> After defending Strangey Town from the wrath of Jaeger, the enemy promises this is only the beginning. War has been declared, and rules of the universe have been upended. Now on a quest for enhanced war titles and allied realms to fight the Red Pact, Alan—broker of gods—will rush to seal the deal before his enemy, and use every negotiating tactic at his disposal to stop universe domination.<br> <br> But things are never so simple....</p> <p>Visitors from the past distort his present, sending his magical attunement into a chaotic spiral of darkness. The memories he once used to evoke light now plague his spirit, leaving him in danger of not only losing his friends, but himself.<br> <br> With his realm in peril he’ll be forced to lean into everything darkly foretold, lest he see it fall.</p> <p>If Alan is to negotiate his way out of this one…the cost might be his soul.<br> <br> <b>Book 2 in this wild LitRPG Isekai adventure about a mortal standing up to gods and showing them the power of a good deal. </b><br> <br> <i>Filled with strange beings, unpredictable gods, slice-of-life elements, power progression, plenty of action, and a main character you can't help but root for.</i></p>"; 
